This notice applies only to the "Covered Material" listed below. The Covered
Material is NOT licensed under the MIT License that covers the rest of the
Woodada repository. All other files remain under the MIT License.

Covered Material
- All files in app/src/Woodada/Sprites/Skins/
  (FlashSkin.cs, GhostSkin.cs, GlitchSkin.cs, IceSkin.cs, KittenSkin.cs)
- All files in app/tools/skin_preview/
- All files in app/src/Woodada/Assets/Dog/ and app/src/Woodada/Assets/Rabbit/
  (the hand-drawn dachshund and rabbit running frames)
- app/tools/draw_dachshund.py and app/tools/draw_rabbit.py
- The code in docs/site.js between the "스페셜 스킨 시작" (special skins start)
  and "스페셜 스킨 끝" (special skins end) comments
- The appearance of the special skins (Flash, Ghost, Glitch, Ice, Kittens)
  rendered by that code, the dachshund and rabbit characters, and images or
  videos showing them (for example docs/assets/og-image.png)

